# Activity

- Source: <%= it.source %>
- Source ID: `<%= it.id %>`
- Type: <%= it.type %>
- Name: <%= it.name %>
- Start: <%= it.start %>

## Session

- Distance: <%= it.session.distance %> [km]
- Moving time: <%= it.session.movingTime %>
- Elapsed time: <%= it.session.elapsedTime %>
- Recording time: <%= it.session.recordingTime %>
- Elevation gain: <%= it.session.elevationGain %>
- Elevation loss: <%= it.session.elevationLoss %>

## Performance

- Average speed: <%= it.performance.averageSpeed %>
- Maximum speed: <%= it.performance.maximumSpeed %>
- Average heart rate: <%= it.performance.averageHeartRate %>
- Maximum heart rate: <%= it.performance.maximumHeartRate %>
- Average power: <%= it.performance.averagePower %>
- Weighted average power: <%= it.performance.weightedAveragePower %>
- <%= it.performance.cadence %>

## Running Dynamics

- Average stride length: <%= it.runningDynamics.averageStrideLength %>
- Average stance time: <%= it.runningDynamics.averageStanceTime %>
- Average stance time percent: <%= it.runningDynamics.averageStanceTimePercent %>
- Average vertical oscillation: <%= it.runningDynamics.averageVerticalOscillation %>
- Average vertical ratio: <%= it.runningDynamics.averageVerticalRatio %>
- Average leg spring stiffness: <%= it.runningDynamics.averageLegSpringStiffness %>

## Environment

- Recorded temperature: <%= it.environment.recordedTemperature %>
- Weather temperature: <%= it.environment.weatherTemperature %>
- Feels-like temperature: <%= it.environment.feelsLikeTemperature %>
- Average wind speed: <%= it.environment.averageWindSpeed %>
- Average wind gust: <%= it.environment.averageWindGust %>
- Headwind: <%= it.environment.headwind %>
- Tailwind: <%= it.environment.tailwind %>

<% if (it.physiology) { %>
## Physiology

- Core temperature: <%= it.physiology.coreTemperatureMin %>–<%= it.physiology.coreTemperatureMax %> [°C]

<% } %>
<% if (it.geography) { %>
## Geography

- GPS coordinate count: <%= it.geography.coordinateCount %>
- Bounding box:
  - North: <%= it.geography.north %> [°]
  - South: <%= it.geography.south %> [°]
  - East: <%= it.geography.east %> [°]
  - West: <%= it.geography.west %> [°]

<% } %>
<% if (it.externalGeography) { %>
## External Geography

- Bounding-box feature matches: <%= it.externalGeography.matchCount %>

<% } %>
## Classification

- Modality: <%= it.classification.modality %>
- Class: <%= it.classification.class %>
- Signals:
<% if (it.classification.signals.length > 0) { %>
<% it.classification.signals.forEach((signal) => { %>  - <%= signal %>
<% }) %>
<% } else { %>  - none
<% } %>

## Training

- Training load: <%= it.training.trainingLoad %>
- HR load: <%= it.training.hrLoad %>
- Pace load: <%= it.training.paceLoad %>
- Power load: <%= it.training.powerLoad %>
- Intensity: <%= it.training.intensity %>
- Decoupling: <%= it.training.decoupling %>
- RPE: <%= it.training.rpe %>
- Feel: <%= it.training.feel %>

## Source

Intervals.icu activity:

`<%= it.id %>`

## Notes

This document is a generated human-readable projection of `source.json` and `streams.json`.

The canonical source evidence is preserved unchanged.

The derived values in this document are calculated from the preserved `streams.json` and semantic classification from `source.json`. They are also preserved in `derived.json`.

External geographic matches are derived from the materialized geography corpus using the activity bounding box.

No semantic interpretation of external geographic matches is applied.
